# Secret files. They belong under /home/mehdi/secrets/ on the VPS and have no
# reason to appear here, but a copy dropped in the tree while testing would be
# one `git add .` away from a public repository. GitLeaks catches these at push,
# once they are already written into history. This catches them before.
# No leading slash on purpose: the pattern matches at any depth.
secrets/
mysql_root_password
mysql_password
jwt_secret